<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-12T18:04:58.975Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:04:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits raided two Niger communities, killing scores and burning houses in Borgu LGA, while suspected herdsmen killed six people in Benue and abducted others. Russian fighters and the Malian army retook the strategic northern town of Kidal after separatists withdrew, and Mali troops re-entered a northern town following a separatist pullout. The Nigerian government faces a US indictment accusing officials of complicity in child-soldier recruitment and baby factories, and an Ijaw traditional ruler died at 64 from reported liposuction complications. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQNm52LUpzM3lIbkZoZ19nako3elM0NWgxTE9RSG1lZGQyRURvU2s1alRaX2EwRjFEYkRac2JlNDdHcE1KdFN0aVBoMFMtcnBaZXRRM3kzLU1JWS1EUHU1YmVuVk13b0NZdm5NTkpzRzVGalNLRjBBRzJmLWVaT252MkNJTFpyVnhzTlhnd0Zfb1VhVTZXTGZlakt1VkY2RVdnZVB0VmdrSGV4ZjFhQnVjd2VhbEthY2hx?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNakE3OGN0MnZyVXc4TzB3azJNSHN4bFlGZi1zLVBZNnhpN1lDQlhRRU9SdEFEMTJrX3R6M2NNTnJ4OWRhM1Z2WkZtNkJjdzlpVHJoWURKMEtpOHJhN2lySzRvY3NCS1dRRTZRcFlFNjU4ODdZbDVTRml1Ymk0a3NzdTNfWE5Nb0VqQWZrelpyRmFfZlVValAzSGswaUk2QzBFOEVNM21sMWhpSmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;THISDAYLIVE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNMmZDLUcyRlE5YTdfVThrSUd6WDl6dWhpTk5GcHVSWm0tOVNQbnoxRkExZ2ZvN3Y5dDZCMmIxcDVxcnA1SFRCWXJkUHl5REx0bnhOaGYwTnlvWGlQQjZ4TEVXdWs3M0ZZOUY1aHVxSHk2dWVSajRDRVY1clBCQ25iMnBoX2JhM25lTXZrQTIxS0c1bHAxZ096b2o2dWhzZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Premium Tim